					"$\\sqrt{ {{eval:k*m^2}}\\times{{eval:k*n^2}} }=\\sqrt{ {{eval:k^2*m^2*n^2}} }=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:k*m*n}}}$."
